<header -size=4>{2D}


<list -bullet=circle>{Fix Atlas Merge Tool crash (<link -body=GH-101407>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101407}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix smart snapping lines to disappear after using the pivot tool (<link -body=GH-105203>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105203}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add "Use Local Space" option to the 2D editor (<link -body=GH-107264>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107264}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fade TileMap editor overlay when zoomed out (<link -body=GH-107573>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107573}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix: Tilemap tools not overriding main editor tools (<link -body=GH-107843>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107843}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Highlight points on hover in the Polygon2D editor (<link -body=GH-107890>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107890}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Reduce TileMapLayerEditor's undo/redo memory usage (<link -body=GH-107969>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107969}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add support for rotating scene tiles in TileMapLayer (<link -body=GH-108010>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108010}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Avoid unnecessary updates in <code>{TileMapLayer} (<link -body=GH-109243>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109243}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix redundant calls of <code>{CanvasItemEditor::<italic>{update}lock<italic>{and}group_button} on <code>{SceneTreeEditor} node selection (<link -body=GH-110320>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110320}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Improve tile source tooltips (<link -body=GH-110328>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110328}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix nested TileMapLayers highlight rendering in editor (<link -body=GH-110768>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110768}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix snap Polygon2D editor (<link -body=GH-110989>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110989}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix game <code>{Camera2D} override from editor and 2D debug templates building (<link -body=GH-111149>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111149}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add zoom to fit functionality to <code>{SpriteFramesEditor} (<link -body=GH-111471>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111471}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix rotation/scale order in <code>{CanvasItem::draw<italic>{set}transform} (<link -body=GH-111476>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111476}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix Camera2D limit checks for inverted boundaries (<link -body=GH-111651>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111651}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix "Match Corners" not correctly updating cells when erasing (<link -body=GH-112145>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112145}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix Polygon2D editor undo crash (<link -body=GH-112241>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112241}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Check for tiles outside texture on TileSet atlas settings changes (<link -body=GH-112271>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112271}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix TileSet editor crash on terrain pick in paint mode (<link -body=GH-112349>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112349}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Change <code>{TileSetScenesCollectionSource} raw pointers in the TileSet editor to ref (<link -body=GH-112739>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112739}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Prevent translating custom data layers (<link -body=GH-112769>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112769}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix <code>{TileMapLayer} transformations for <code>{Node2D} scene tiles (<link -body=GH-112790>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112790}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{FTI: - <code>{Camera2D} accepts resets only after entering tree (<link -body=GH-112810>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112810}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix <code>{display_placeholder} not persisting (<link -body=GH-112828>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112828}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Enable Vertical orientation for TileMap Dock (<link -body=GH-113128>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113128}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix TileMap Dock button placement and errors (<link -body=GH-113594>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113594}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix <code>{get<italic>{scene}tile<italic>{display}placeholder} erroring for transformed scene tiles (<link -body=GH-113856>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113856}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix incorrect error message placement in TileMap Dock (<link -body=GH-113870>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113870}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix undo/redo for adding scene tiles (<link -body=GH-114604>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114604}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix pattern corruption in <code>{TileMapLayer} (<link -body=GH-114653>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114653}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Geometry2D: Remove <code>{arc_tolerance} scaling and the comment related to that (<link -body=GH-115293>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115293}).}

<header -size=4>{3D}


<list -bullet=circle>{Commit transforms done with editor gizmo on tool mode switch (<link -body=GH-86930>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/86930}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix 3D editor Emulate Numpad setting having no effect when previewing a camera (<link -body=GH-93724>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93724}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Get <code>{Node3D.global_rotation} from orthonormalized global basis (<link -body=GH-95075>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95075}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Rename Select Mode to Transform Mode, and create a new Select Mode without transform gizmo (<link -body=GH-101168>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101168}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix viewport rotation gizmo aligned axis reversing (<link -body=GH-101209>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101209}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Move editor viewport gizmos visibility logic out of process notification (<link -body=GH-102020>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102020}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Remove redundant line when toggling cinematic preview (<link -body=GH-102021>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102021}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Condition editor viewport nav modifier checks on freelook / mouse is captured (<link -body=GH-102055>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102055}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{TextureEditors: Compile shader/material only once (<link -body=GH-104488>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104488}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{GridMap: fix cell scale not applying to the cursor mesh (<link -body=GH-104510>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104510}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add Bresenham Line Algorithm to GridMap Drawing (<link -body=GH-105292>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105292}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix ghost collisions in <code>{segment<italic>{intersects}convex()} (<link -body=GH-106084>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106084}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Change snap settings to not use LineEdits (<link -body=GH-106684>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106684}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Always use a dark background for 3D editor overlays even with light theme (<link -body=GH-107154>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107154}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Visual feedback update for viewport rotation gizmo (<link -body=GH-107343>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107343}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Do not require editor restart when changing Path 3d Tilt Disk Size setting (<link -body=GH-108546>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108546}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Do not require editor restart when changing manipulator gizmo opacity setting (<link -body=GH-108549>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108549}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Create a rotation arc showing accumulated rotation when using transform gizmo (<link -body=GH-108576>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108576}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Make rotation gizmo white outline a 4th handle that rotates around the camera's view-axis (<link -body=GH-108608>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108608}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix jump when cutting a selection in Gridmap (<link -body=GH-108743>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108743}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Remove spurious <code>{Curve3D} <code>{changed} signals (<link -body=GH-109220>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109220}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Move <code>{Lock View Rotation} label logic out of process notification (<link -body=GH-109490>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109490}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Remove unused editor setting <code>{editors/grid<italic>{map/palette}min_width} (<link -body=GH-109582>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109582}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{GLTF export: use ORM texture for occlusion/metallicRoughnessTexture if it exists (<link -body=GH-109845>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109845}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix <code>{GridMap} Move Action Undo/Redo/Cancel (<link -body=GH-109878>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109878}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix numpad emulation in 3d navigation shortcuts (<link -body=GH-110428>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110428}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Remove <code>{pixel_size} precision limit in Sprite3D (<link -body=GH-111491>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111491}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Implement orbit snapping in 3D viewport (<link -body=GH-111509>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111509}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Improve Transform dialog (<link -body=GH-111600>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111600}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix the material preview sphere model (<link -body=GH-112046>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112046}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix <code>{CollisionPolygon3D} debug shape rendering (<link -body=GH-112285>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112285}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix GridMap <code>{cursor_instance} transparency error spam (<link -body=GH-112301>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112301}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Remove undefined method <code>{Skeleton3D::remove_bone} (<link -body=GH-112402>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112402}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Don't redraw <code>{Sprite3D}/<code>{AnimatedSprite3D} outside the tree (<link -body=GH-112593>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112593}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add MeshInstance3D upgrade code (<link -body=GH-112607>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112607}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix wrong AABB when selecting Node3D gizmo in editor (<link -body=GH-112666>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112666}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix preview CSG interfering with itself during drag and drop (<link -body=GH-112861>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112861}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Default the 3D editor to Transform mode to restore 4.5 behavior (<link -body=GH-113458>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113458}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Prevent BonePropertiesEditor crash due to skeleton use-after-release (<link -body=GH-113631>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113631}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Node3DEditorViewport: Prevent crash while handling input (<link -body=GH-113895>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113895}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Debugger: Fix 3D disabled builds (<link -body=GH-113962>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113962}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix <code>{sorting_offset} property flags for <code>{Decal} (<link -body=GH-114335>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114335}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix rotation gizmo line position (<link -body=GH-114408>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114408}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix crash when selecting SplineIK3D (<link -body=GH-114668>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114668}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Keep other parts of transform gizmo visible when rotating in local mode (<link -body=GH-114714>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114714}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix <code>{Sprite3D} modulate propagation on reparenting (<link -body=GH-115037>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115037}).}

<header -size=4>{Animation}


<list -bullet=circle>{Fix animation loop import hints becoming lost (<link -body=GH-91634>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91634}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add tests for <code>{AnimationPlayer} (<link -body=GH-92649>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92649}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Use <code>{LocalVector} in <code>{Animation} (<link -body=GH-101285>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101285}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Minor Animation Player workflow enhancements (<link -body=GH-103416>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103416}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix issue of <code>{AnimationPlayer} hiding bezier editor when re-selecting it (<link -body=GH-104371>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104371}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add <code>{interpolate<italic>{via}rest()} static func to Animation class (<link -body=GH-107423>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107423}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Display AnimationTree editor warnings when the node is disabled (<link -body=GH-107468>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107468}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add toggle for inserting keys/markers at current time vs mouse cursor's position (<link -body=GH-107511>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107511}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add ability to copy and paste animations in SpriteFrames (<link -body=GH-107887>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107887}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add "Go to Next/Previous Keyframe" to Animation Edit menu (<link -body=GH-107959>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107959}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Propagate <code>{Tween.kill()} to subtweens (<link -body=GH-108227>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108227}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix missing shortcuts for play buttons in SpriteFrames Editor (<link -body=GH-109422>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109422}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Allow reconnecting AnimationNodeStateMachine transitions (<link -body=GH-109534>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109534}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Correctly reset StateMachine opacity when a node is played or renamed (<link -body=GH-109605>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109605}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Make BlendSpace selection tool consistent with StateMachine/BlendTree functionality (<link -body=GH-109792>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109792}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Double-click BlendSpace points to open their editor (<link -body=GH-109839>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109839}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Expose <code>{get<italic>{fading}...} methods for <code>{AnimationNodeStateMachinePlayback} (<link -body=GH-109986>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109986}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add <code>{SkeletonModifier3D} IKs as <code>{IKModifier3D} (<link -body=GH-110120>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110120}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Improve deselection in AnimationTree editors and inspector (<link -body=GH-110131>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110131}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Trim -loop & -cycle from animations during Godot 3 to 4 conversion (<link -body=GH-110188>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110188}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix Skeleton2D TwoBoneIK and LookAt mirroring (<link -body=GH-110298>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110298}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add option to <code>{BoneConstraint3D} to make reference target allow to set <code>{Node3D} (<link -body=GH-110336>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110336}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add option to keying modified transform by <code>{SkeletonModifier3D} (<link -body=GH-110376>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110376}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix <code>{<italic>{validate}property()} in <code>{RetargetModifier3D} (<link -body=GH-110380>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110380}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Optimize <code>{Animation::<italic>{track}update_hash} (<link -body=GH-110400>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110400}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix read-only state for Skeleton and Inspector (<link -body=GH-110487>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110487}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Change AnimationLibrary serialization to avoid using Dictionary (<link -body=GH-110502>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110502}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix Reset on Save corrupt poses if scene has multiple Skeletons (<link -body=GH-110506>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110506}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Ensure the AnimationPlayer emits <code>{animation_finished} for every animation (<link -body=GH-110508>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110508}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix imported animation warning labeled as Imported Scene (<link -body=GH-110619>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110619}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Allow resizing the length of animations by dragging the timeline (<link -body=GH-110623>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110623}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Change list of Tweeners from Vector to LocalVector (<link -body=GH-110656>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110656}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Show marker lines/sections in the animation bezier editor (<link -body=GH-110676>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110676}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix AnimationPlayer to use StringName instead of String in the exposed API (<link -body=GH-110767>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110767}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add solo/hide/lock/delete buttons to node groups in bezier track editor (<link -body=GH-110866>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110866}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix backward/pingpong root motion in AnimationTree (<link -body=GH-110982>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110982}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Make extended SkeletonModifiers retrieve interpolated global transform (<link -body=GH-110987>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110987}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Expose <code>{is_valid()} from <code>{AnimationPlayer} to make detecting paused animations possible (<link -body=GH-111178>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111178}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D (<link -body=GH-111184>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111184}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix incorrect AnimationNodeAnimation <code>{timeline_length} description (<link -body=GH-111251>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111251}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Make StateMachinePlayback set <code>{Start} state as default in constructor (<link -body=GH-111325>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111325}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add relative option to LookAt/AimModifier3D (<link -body=GH-111367>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111367}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Change Vector to LocalVector in SpringBoneSimulator3D (<link -body=GH-111378>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111378}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Set step before set value, to fix animation length issue (<link -body=GH-111398>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111398}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix crash when rearranging filtered animation tracks (<link -body=GH-111427>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111427}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Seek to beginning of section if current playback position is after its end (<link -body=GH-111517>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111517}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix unwanted blend position movement (<link -body=GH-111803>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111803}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Allow Spring / IK to set mutable bone axes (<link -body=GH-111815>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111815}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Improve validation for adding transition in StateMachine (<link -body=GH-111935>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111935}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Remember animation snapping state (<link -body=GH-111952>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111952}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Separate branching ping-pong time and delta (<link -body=GH-112047>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112047}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add "Abort on Reset" property to AnimationNodeOneShot (<link -body=GH-112054>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112054}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Track groups in Animation tab hover highlight (<link -body=GH-112148>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112148}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Improve Bezier Default Mode button in Animation dock (<link -body=GH-112231>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112231}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Remove default skeleton path in MeshInstance3D (<link -body=GH-112267>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112267}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix NodeOneShot doesn't reset correctly (<link -body=GH-112450>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112450}).}
