<list -bullet=circle>{OpenXR: Fix errors reported by <code>{XrApiLayer<italic>{core}validation} (<link -body=GH-109969>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109969}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Add <code>{quest3s} to the list of supported devices (<link -body=GH-110465>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110465}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix XR tracker name changing at runtime (<link -body=GH-110703>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110703}).}
