<list -bullet=circle>{Fix late destruction access violation with OpenXRAPIExtension object (<link -body=GH-110868>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110868}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Use const ref parameters in the OpenXR module (<link -body=GH-110948>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110948}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{More XR disable for Viewport and export (<link -body=GH-111185>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111185}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Emit <code>{format_changed} on CameraFeed datatype change (<link -body=GH-111206>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111206}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Fix small code layout issue in persistence scope initialization (<link -body=GH-111307>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111307}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Ensure <code>{XrRenderModelPropertiesEXT::type} is initialized (<link -body=GH-111434>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111434}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Make <code>{XRPose} only set name on creation instead of on pose update (<link -body=GH-111538>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111538}).}
