<list -bullet=circle>{Android: Deprecate and remove vendors specific XR APIs (<link -body=GH-111870>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111870}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Android: Stabilize camera lifecycle handling (<link -body=GH-111871>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111871}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Android editor: Add support for Android XR devices to the Godot XR Editor (<link -body=GH-112777>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112777}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Support reading available OpenXR runtimes from Windows registry (<link -body=GH-112884>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112884}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Implement <code>{XR<italic>{KHR}android<italic>{thread}settings} (<link -body=GH-112889>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112889}).}
