<list -bullet=circle>{OpenXR: Add profiling macro for process, <code>{xrWaitFrame()} and acquiring swapchain (<link -body=GH-112893>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112893}).}
<list -bullet=circle>{Android editor: Ensure that the Android editor properly passes hybrid data when switching mode (<link -body=GH-112928>{https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112928}).}
